WEBVTT

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:31.463
not just from the conversation,

00:03:31.497 --> 00:03:34.330
but even from the relationship.

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:40.397
It's actually one of the causes
of unfriending, online and off.

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:43.330
So instead, you might consider a technique

00:03:43.363 --> 00:03:46.330
made popular by the Hollywood
producer Brian Grazer,

00:03:46.363 --> 00:03:48.663
the curiosity conversation.

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:52.563
And the whole point
of a curiosity conversation

00:03:52.597 --> 00:03:55.697
is to understand
the other person's perspective,

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:58.530
to see what's on their side of the fence.

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.897
And so the next time